WEBVTT

00:20:59.121 --> 00:21:02.954
you can use your logical system
to to choose to slow down,

00:21:03.079 --> 00:21:07.121
to pay attention and to understand what
that emotion is trying to tell you,

00:21:07.788 --> 00:21:11.204
rather than following your instinct and
pushing the difficult emotions away.

00:21:11.454 --> 00:21:15.913
Engage both systems so that you can make
thoughtful decisions with your emotions

00:21:15.913 --> 00:21:19.538
in mind. Remember when I
said I hadn't cried in

00:21:19.538 --> 00:21:22.871
a meeting with work colleagues I've
talked with for over seven years?

00:21:23.454 --> 00:21:26.329
That's because most of my life I've
suppressed my emotions at work

00:21:26.329 --> 00:21:30.496
and often not at work. I've felt
like that cartoon character,